274
00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:38.410
It's one of the best

275
00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:38.950
speeches ever.

276
00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:39.750
It's so great.

277
00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.250
And then the whole thank you

278
00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.770
is from Nancy's perspective.

279
00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:43.410
Yes.

280
00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:45.290
And it's really funny.

281
00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:46.350
Steve was invited

282
00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:47.910
